/*
 * Declares the TagSymbol class, and the TagSite, TagResolution and TagOverload records.
 *
 * TagSymbol represents a tag declaration(`TagDecl`), and TagSite one of the
 * tags written on top of a declaration, `#[name(args)]`, kept on the symbol
 * it tags. TagResolution is a site resolved for that symbol, with the
 * TagOverloads applying to it.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::symbol::tag
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/symbol/tag.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-10-21
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
